        measure
      </h2>
      <p style="font: var(--ds-type-p); max-width: var(--ds-layout-measure); margin: 0px;">
        Body copy is capped at
        <code style="font: var(--ds-type-overline); color: var(--ds-color-text-secondary);">
          var(--ds-layout-measure)
        </code>
        so line length stays readable. This paragraph is exactly that wide — around 68 characters per line, the upper end of comfortable reading.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
`;

